    <dashboard name='SQ 1 Story' type='storyboard'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>SQ1 — Where should the investor buy?</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='width' value='1001' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='964' maxwidth='1016' minheight='964' minwidth='1016' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98340' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98426' x='787' y='830'>
            <zone h='4357' id='3' type-v2='title' w='98426' x='787' y='830' />
            <zone fixed-size='144' h='14938' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98426' x='787' y='5187' />
            <zone h='79045' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98426' x='787' y='20125'>
              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='The dashboard initially highlights a clear price hierarchy across London boroughs. Westminster (£215), Kensington &amp; Chelsea (£207.5), and the City of London (£200) form a distinct premium tier, separated from the rest of the market by a noticeable margin. This ranking provides the investor with an immediate shortlist of high-value areas. The visual emphasis on the top three boroughs allows for quick identification of potential investment locations without requiring further interaction.&#10;' captured-sheet='SQ1 ' id='1' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{2C3D3FD4-3BE2-4070-BFF7-65544946B513}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard name='SQ 2 Story' type='storyboard'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>SQ2 — Understanding the availability–demand relationship</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='width' value='980' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='964' maxwidth='1016' minheight='964' minwidth='1016' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98340' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98426' x='787' y='830'>
            <zone h='4357' id='3' type-v2='title' w='98426' x='787' y='830' />
            <zone fixed-size='172' h='17842' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98426' x='787' y='5187' />
            <zone h='76141' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98426' x='787' y='23029'>
              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='The relationship between availability and demand is not uniform across London. While most boroughs follow a relatively weak positive trend, a small number of outliers behave differently. The City of London and Hillingdon show significantly higher demand relative to their availability, indicating more efficient occupancy. Selecting an outlier borough filters the dashboard, allowing the investor to observe how its listings behave spatially and across performance metrics. This suggests that certain areas benefit from stronger demand dynamics, likely driven by tourism or business activity.&#10;' captured-sheet='SQ2 Availability vs Demand' id='1' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{8165B338-3D6B-4108-983A-214F87055663}' />
    </dashboard>
